# AI Chatbot Configuration
# Add your AI API keys here to enable real AI responses

# OpenAI API Key (Get from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys)
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Google Gemini API Key (Get from: https://ai.google.dev/)
# Alternative to OpenAI - has a generous free tier
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Backend API origin (production)
# Example: https://my-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env in your Client directory
# 2. Replace "your-api-key-here" with your actual API key
# 3. Restart your development server after adding keys
# 4. The chatbot will automatically detect and use available API keys

# Note: If no API keys are provided, the chatbot will fall back to 
# intelligent mock responses with keyword matching

# Deployment notes:
# - On Vercel, set `VITE_API_URL` to your Render backend origin.
# - Restart the frontend if env vars change.
